                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
                   <p>
   <lb n="1"/>sabvamasastu jayātireka 1550 saṁmr̥ddhi saka roṅa (qna)-
    <lb n="2"/>’ksatra khae bisāka 13 keta candabārasāranā juṁnuṁ qna-<!-- kuch: ’ksatra -->
   <lb n="3"/>ka braḥ dharmmakhitti mahāsa˘gharāja pubitra nū qnaka pūrapañā<!-- kuch: mahāsa˘gharāja -->
   <lb n="4"/>nū qnaka samteca braḥ pañājeta nū qnaka Aṁmma nū qnaka ppa-
   <lb n="5"/>ñādassī qnaka daṁṅ A˘mpala neḥ jā sākasīỵ baecañāṇa<!-- kuch: daṁ.ṅ the ṅa was written as subscript; A˘mpala -->
   <lb n="6"/>cauva Ūdaiỵsmata nū nāṅa māha māna citra sarddhā sāṅa braḥ bu-
   <lb n="7"/>ddharrapa Aṅga 3 braḥ māsa 1 braḥ prā˘ka 1braḥ samnaha 1 pañcuḥ-<!-- kuch: prā˘ka -->
   <lb n="8"/>ha nū braḥ ba˘na prosa khñuṁma 2 mūỵ jhmoḥ qnaka cauva kissa-<!-- kuch: ba˘na -->
   <lb n="9"/>sūra mūỵ jhmoḥ me naṅa me naṅa neḥ qnaka qnaka jā doḥ po-
   <lb n="10"/>ṅa phUna kamūya kūna cauva Aña Eṅa ktī peha niṅa sra-
   <lb n="11"/>tīỵha geha daṁṅ biỵra neḥ yoka jā khñuṁma viña leỵ doḥ<!-- kuch: tīỵha ; daṁṅ ; biỵra ; leỵ the ya and ṅa were written as subscripts.  -->
   <lb n="12"/>braḥ buddha tra˘sa A˘mpala ksaeca dova heỵ ktī niṅa moka<!-- kuch: tra˘sa ; A˘mpala -->
   <lb n="13"/>tra˘sa E kroya Aṁ˘mpala ksaeca kti kuṁmpī prosa qnaka noḥ<!-- kuch: tra˘sa ; Aṁ˘mpala -->
   <lb n="14"/>leỵ hoṅa Oya qnaka noḥ dova keta dova nā pañcā-<!-- kuch: ley the ya was written as subscript. -->
   <lb n="15"/>nanatarr̥ika nruka tala 500 saena jāta kti kuṁmpī ltoḥ-
   <lb n="16"/>ha Amvīya pañcānanatarr̥ika nruka noḥ leỵ hoṅa <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
                   </p>
</div>
